JUST IN: The House just voted 215-211 in favor of attaching the SAVE America Act to must-pass legislation.

A special rules resolution directs the House to attach the election integrity bill to the National Defense Authorization Act (NDAA). 

@RepLuna will join us on The Benny Show tomorrow to discuss this groundbreaking step toward getting the SAVE America Act PASSED. 🇺🇸

